---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="CS graduate building projects and growing as a software developer."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-06-24')}
>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm Krister — a CS graduate passionate about software development. I'm actively building
		personal projects to sharpen my skills and work toward landing a software engineering role.
		This site is where I document that journey: the projects I'm building, the problems I'm
		solving, and the things I'm learning along the way.
	</p>

	<h2>What I Work With</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>C++ / C#</strong> — my primary languages, used for systems programming and application development</li>
		<li><strong>JavaScript</strong> — for web projects and front-end work</li>
		<li><strong>Java</strong> — familiar with the ecosystem and OOP patterns</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>What I'm Up To</h2>
	<p>
		I'm focused on building a portfolio of real projects that demonstrate what I can do. Each
		project on this site comes with a write-up covering the problem it solves, the decisions I
		made, and what I learned. Check out the <a href="/projects">Projects</a> page to see what
		I've been working on, or follow along on the <a href="/blog">Blog</a> for updates as I build.
	</p>

	<h2>Get In Touch</h2>
	<p>
		I'm always open to connecting with other developers and exploring opportunities. You can find
		me here:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="https://github.com/KristerJLawlor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> — my code and projects</li>
		<li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/YOUR-LINKEDIN-HANDLE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a> — professional profile</li>
		<li><a href="mailto:KristerJLawlor@gmail.com">KristerJLawlor@gmail.com</a> — email me directly</li>
	</ul>
</Layout>
